itle":"Call Me Az","synopsis":"Wakaba has come to live with the mysterious creature Po-chan. Reiko Higashi, a transfer student who loves occultism, is also interested in Wakaba, and every day becomes a little brighter. However, the ghosts who are not interested in it start to surprise A-chan ...?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"98070","synopsis":"いつも若葉に嫌がらせをしているクラスメイトの雨山は、\n\nあーちゃんに「実は若葉ちゃんが好きなんでしょ？」と図星を突かれてうろたえる。\n\n追い込まれた雨山が取った行動により、事態は思わぬ方向へ転がっていき……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746056.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"いつも若葉に嫌がらせをしているクラスメイトの雨山は、\n\nあーちゃんに「実は若葉ちゃんが好きなんでしょ？」と図星を突かれてうろたえる。\n\n追い込まれた雨山が取った行動により、事態は思わぬ方向へ転がっていき……？","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"},"tvdb":{"title":"The Sunset of Youth","synopsis":"Ameyama, a classmate who always harasses Wakaba, is upset by A-chan, saying, \"You really like Wakaba, right?\" Due to the actions taken by Ameyama, the situation rolls in an unexpected direction ...?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"98071","synopsis":"心霊スポット調査をするというあーちゃんに連れられて公園に来た若葉。\n\nそこに大きな生首の幽霊が現れ、興奮したあーちゃんが幽霊を怒らせてしまう。\n\nその日はポーちゃんが不在だったこともあり、大きな悲劇が起こってしまう。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746057.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"心霊スポット調査をするというあーちゃんに連れられて公園に来た若葉。\n\nそこに大きな生首の幽霊が現れ、興奮したあーちゃんが幽霊を怒らせてしまう。\n\nその日はポーちゃんが不在だったこともあり、大きな悲劇が起こってしまう。","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"},"tvdb":{"title":"Dark Sunday","synopsis":"Wakaba came to the park with her to do a psychic spot survey. A big ghost with a raw neck appears there, and the excited A-chan makes the ghost angry. Po-chan was absent on that day, and a big tragedy would occur.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"98072","synopsis":"瀕死となったあーちゃんを救うべく、ポーちゃんの不思議な能力で「あの世」へ来た若葉。\n\n絶対に生きたいと願うあーちゃんと、絶対に友達を助けたいと願う若葉。\n\nタイムリミットが迫る中、二人の願いは届くのか……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746059.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"瀕死となったあーちゃんを救うべく、ポーちゃんの不思議な能力で「あの世」へ来た若葉。\n\n絶対に生きたいと願うあーちゃんと、絶対に友達を助けたいと願う若葉。\n\nタイムリミットが迫る中、二人の願いは届くのか……？","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"},"tvdb":{"title":"Next Stop, the Afterlife","synopsis":"Wakaba who came to \"the world\" with Po-chan's mysterious ability to save the dying A-chan. A-chan, who absolutely wants to live, and Wakaba, who absolutely wants to help her friends. As the time limit approaches, will their wishes arrive ...?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"98073","synopsis":"若葉は、別のクラスの同級生・結城直哉が幽霊と対峙している所を目撃する。\n\n結城は自分と同じ能力を持っているのかもしれない。\n\nそして、その苦しみをよく知っている若葉は、結城に声を掛ける。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746060.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"若葉は、別のクラスの同級生・結城直哉が幽霊と対峙している所を目撃する。\n\n結城は自分と同じ能力を持っているのかもしれない。\n\nそして、その苦しみをよく知っている若葉は、結城に声を掛ける。","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"},"tvdb":{"title":"Birds of a Feather Flock Apart","synopsis":"Wakaba witnesses another classmate, Naoya Yuki, confronting a ghost. Yuki may have the same ability as himself. Wakaba, who is familiar with the suffering, calls out to Yuki.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"98074","synopsis":"話しかけても耳を傾けない結城に、どうしていいか分からず思い悩む若葉。\n\nそんな中、あーちゃんが風邪で休んだ日を狙って、クラスの女子が若葉をからかい始める。\n\nその場面を目撃した結城と雨山が思いがけない行動を取り……？","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746061.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"話しかけても耳を傾けない結城に、どうしていいか分からず思い悩む若葉。\n\nそんな中、あーちゃんが風邪で休んだ日を狙って、クラスの女子が若葉をからかい始める。\n\nその場面を目撃した結城と雨山が思いがけない行動を取り……？","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"},"tvdb":{"title":"Unseen Confusion","synopsis":"Wakaba is worried because she doesn't know what to do with Yuki who doesn't listen even if she talks to her. Meanwhile, the girls in the class start teasing Wakaba, aiming for the day when A-chan took a rest due to a cold. Yuki and Ameyama who witnessed the scene took unexpected actions ...?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"108912","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"275672","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"98075","synopsis":"ポーちゃんに触れて以来、夢の中にまでポーちゃんが現れて悩む結城。\n\nその夢の中でポーちゃんは、自分を苦しめる能力を捨てられる場所があると言うのだ。\n\nその話を聞いた若葉は、結城に思い切った提案を持ちかける。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/275672/4746063.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"ポーちゃんに触れて以来、夢の中にまでポーちゃんが現れて悩む結城。\n\nその夢の中でポーちゃんは、自分を苦しめる能力を捨てられる場所があると言うのだ。\n\nその話を聞いた若葉は、結城に思い切った提案を持ちかける。","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"},"tvdb":{"title":"A Light in the Darkness","synopsis":"Since touching Po-chan, Yuki has been worried about Po-chan appearing in her dreams. In that dream, Po says there is a place where he can abandon his ability to afflict himself. Wakaba hears the story and proposes a drastic proposal to Yuki.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10271","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20525","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21325","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmd